00:05:36.711 --> 00:05:37.295
- Pat Summitt.

00:05:37.295 --> 00:05:38.629
- We’ll end on that note.

00:05:38.629 --> 00:05:40.131
- I got triple digits on that one.

00:05:40.131 --> 00:05:42.467
- Kara, appreciate you for coming to the pool hall.

00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:43.634
Best of luck to you in the Olympics

00:05:43.634 --> 00:05:45.094
and best of luck to do with the season, all right?

00:05:45.094 --> 00:05:45.803
- Yeah, let’s go.

